  {
   "key": "0x10..0x1F",
   "name": "Cursor or Display Shift",
   "regions": [
    {
     "ref": "datasheet:HD44780.raw.txt",
     "lines": "1656-1661"
    },
    {
     "ref": "datasheet:HD44780.raw.txt",
     "lines": "1792-1799"
    },
    {
     "ref": "datasheet:HD44780.raw.txt",
     "lines": "1986-1991"
    },
    {
     "ref": "mame:src/devices/video/hd44780.cpp",
     "lines": "677-688"
    }
   ],
   "rows": [
    {
     "n": "1",
     "on": "is",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "Cursor or display shift is instruction 0001 S/C R/L, with DB1 and DB0 shown as dashes in Table 6.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:HD44780.raw.txt",
       "lines": "1656-1659",
       "sha": "b6a6dc7eb589ca8ee1293db2b7dc7a4814e672e3663c7148d70780fc6494a0d6"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "2",
     "on": "write",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "Cursor or display shift moves the cursor position or the display right or left without writing or reading display data.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:HD44780.raw.txt",
       "lines": "1793",
       "sha": "027a7041f508838389ab56dfe0cc5ed83da51368c6e0facdad3ab3938441e11c"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "3",
     "on": "is",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "It is used to correct or search the display.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:HD44780.raw.txt",
       "lines": "1794",
       "sha": "30364d521e688c9e633618c99d8b6380ab1609e17c3d3e186b3db010a354eb64"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "4",
     "on": "is",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "In a 2-line display the cursor moves to the second line after the 40th digit of the first, and both lines shift at the same time.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:HD44780.raw.txt",
       "lines": "1794-1796",
       "sha": "96c7d2b51692d7854ec2d183c16d8ea5997560cc359feeca29487aa7d675fe67"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "5",
     "on": "is",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "When the displayed data is shifted repeatedly each line moves only horizontally, and the second line does not shift into the first line position.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:HD44780.raw.txt",
       "lines": "1797-1798",
       "sha": "101048d930e4300399cab4502c332dce36c824b9661e8677a1af7c3e1bf961a9"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "6",
     "on": "is",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "The address counter contents do not change if the only action performed is a display shift.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:HD44780.raw.txt",
       "lines": "1799",
       "sha": "ba0a77ea0c985a20b409ec9d36f6449a80a27ad82ea58ab6927a9174a869500e"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "7",
     "on": "write",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "With S/C = 0 the cursor shifts left and the address counter is decremented when R/L = 0, right and incremented when R/L = 1.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:HD44780.raw.txt",
       "lines": "1986-1989",
       "sha": "e3cb4a6cc27bb41736fcc035e5541dc61a9e44c7662531aad2e921a4ab02b929"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "8",
     "on": "write",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "With S/C = 1 the entire display shifts left when R/L = 0 and right when R/L = 1, and the cursor follows the display shift.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:HD44780.raw.txt",
       "lines": "1990-1991",
       "sha": "28aa13732e41d9c0f86525c6d532e596096c7f5fce495dafbef93986a88503ba"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "9",
     "on": "is",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "Table 6 says it moves the cursor and shifts the display without changing DDRAM contents.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:HD44780.raw.txt",
       "lines": "1659-1661",
       "sha": "f8779ef73cff7dbf6e4b4e4cb6cbbbc295bec9947382466ed58972ef8d63c1ab"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "101",
     "on": "when",
     "of": "mame",
     "vs": "differs",
     "row": "8",
     "text": "MAME draws the cursor at the shifted position, as the row says, but moves the visible text left when R/L = 1 and right when R/L = 0, the opposite.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "mame:src/devices/video/hd44780.cpp",
       "lines": "678",
       "sha": "b39728701659fe0818d402c0dbfe483eb8ff1339ead61ca740f0067580197185"
      },
      {
       "ref": "mame:src/devices/video/hd44780.cpp",
       "lines": "683",
       "sha": "01e8b696a6f0299c97c7727fe26390936a9fc7453ecebaebf7dc15899aee626e"
      },
      {
       "ref": "mame:src/devices/video/hd44780.cpp",
       "lines": "411",
       "sha": "5bd4a638222c063249f91181b692395b6931ae48a5b9bb1d68885c85e2c24464"
      },
      {
       "ref": "mame:src/devices/video/hd44780.cpp",
       "lines": "484",
       "sha": "2894095e0adca666badf1aee283ebec5bf18964c188df71c9ca757bc694484e5"
      },
      {
       "ref": "mame:src/devices/video/hd44780.cpp",
       "lines": "504-508",
       "sha": "5d3b7145b6269ae8216bc5a9d0937e1e6abb8651ea4559c6d9ba590d8b338771"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
