  {
   "key": "0x20..0x3F",
   "name": "Function Set",
   "regions": [
    {
     "ref": "datasheet:HD44780.raw.txt",
     "lines": "1663-1667"
    },
    {
     "ref": "datasheet:HD44780.raw.txt",
     "lines": "1800-1808"
    },
    {
     "ref": "datasheet:HD44780.raw.txt",
     "lines": "1992-2002"
    },
    {
     "ref": "mame:src/devices/video/hd44780.cpp",
     "lines": "653-674"
    }
   ],
   "rows": [
    {
     "n": "1",
     "on": "is",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "Function set is instruction 001 DL N F, with DB1 and DB0 shown as dashes in Table 6.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:HD44780.raw.txt",
       "lines": "1663-1665",
       "sha": "8b336cf5661000c0b4bf46349ad329e9203471719c14e407a2d2d27c7dfaea52"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "2",
     "on": "write",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "Function set stores DL, the interface data length: 8 bits when DL = 1, 4 bits when DL = 0, and 4-bit data is sent twice.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:HD44780.raw.txt",
       "lines": "1801-1803",
       "sha": "41cfdc55eba55b0015483822e34cfa207e105a7830a541c3f1ccd59549f2cc5d"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "3",
     "on": "write",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "Function set stores N, the number of display lines.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:HD44780.raw.txt",
       "lines": "1804",
       "sha": "066b9a9a2aee4735dc61ea1200a7a03c071138edf894580e1235d0a1d8bbfc65"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "4",
     "on": "write",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "Function set stores F, the character font.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:HD44780.raw.txt",
       "lines": "1805",
       "sha": "a03659d00e8ef5a9060d42d2b7007ca081a0e8e4df734db387bdb17caa011d30"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "5",
     "on": "is",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "The function set belongs at the head of the program before any instruction except reading the busy flag; after that it cannot run unless the data length changes.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:HD44780.raw.txt",
       "lines": "1806-1808",
       "sha": "7e55691f81a0f2dd92da277a51c1806512f0c3097f18e1b58edc306240ba88a5"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "6",
     "on": "is",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "Table 8: N = 0 and F = 0 is one 5x8 line at duty 1/8; N = 0 and F = 1 is one 5x10 line at duty 1/11.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:HD44780.raw.txt",
       "lines": "1992-2000",
       "sha": "c7c3fa61e5536d25507682ace3fc56faa8c0fe526cc1ab7b60e11ce7eb5daf72"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "7",
     "on": "write",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "With N = 1 the display is two 5x8 lines, and two lines cannot be had with the 5x10 font.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:HD44780.raw.txt",
       "lines": "2001",
       "sha": "42c77287ac36eafeb82f87fbf4554e52541d7ad97548886c11811a10fcae3b79"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "8",
     "on": "is",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "The asterisk in the N column of Table 8 means don't care.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:HD44780.raw.txt",
       "lines": "1992-2002",
       "sha": "8c30c3686135b6cd2b12f477dceb54f7de1883642139bf6dab6926b250aec246"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "9",
     "on": "is",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "Table 6 says it sets the interface data length (DL), number of display lines (N) and character font (F).",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:HD44780.raw.txt",
       "lines": "1665-1667",
       "sha": "cc1fab4adbed725126f10c6ca6484315ac37cc197c17c5a94d322d56e2b90245"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "101",
     "on": "when",
     "of": "mame",
     "vs": "extra",
     "text": "After the change MAME corrects the address counter to the new line count, mapping it back into the allowed range.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "mame:src/devices/video/hd44780.cpp",
       "lines": "669",
       "sha": "970bdf3d2e5a633d57a9e1355ca1a3695d071393cb3d628091ba93fc7d3e2591"
      },
      {
       "ref": "mame:src/devices/video/hd44780.cpp",
       "lines": "382-393",
       "sha": "fe3cc38476ecfea11677048720f81dc00a0051d484b363d4a6c06294408672ad"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "10",
     "on": "is",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "Table 8 gives N = 1 two 5x8 lines at duty 1/16.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:HD44780.raw.txt",
       "lines": "1992-2001",
       "sha": "6455ee20eae65b81b996136ec06c127424b4d8adb2ef05a04c1c59c5647fcb98"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
   "closed": [
    {
     "ref": "datasheet:HD44780.raw.txt",
     "lines": "1800",
     "as": "key"
    },
    {
     "ref": "mame:src/devices/video/hd44780.cpp",
     "lines": "667",
